 All you need is a charged cell phone\, comfy shoes and weather appropriate
  clothing. Never been canvassing? We will make sure you get to canvass wit
 h a partner.
LOCATION:Elizabethtown\, PA
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/friendsofjamesmalone/event/967369/
