 ploads/event/Elizabethtown%20Meet%20%26%20Greet_20260716122459183731.png
DESCRIPTION:Come and meet Senator James Malone and State House Candidate H
 ugh Darlington right in your community! This will be a casual drop-in even
 t with the opportunity to have some coffee\, crepes\, and chat with the Se
 nator and learn how to get involved.
